{"id":"n62885-1-9","stage":0,"title":"후 · 后","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62885-1-9-1","ko":"승규 있어요?","zh":"承奎在吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎。","readings":[{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규","audio":"/audio/20c7bbd00a1a5f26d499.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요?","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e52c8004fe894f7cf5ea.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62885-1-9-2","ko":"지금 없는데요. 십 분 후에 다시 전화 주세요.","zh":"他现在不在。请十分钟后再打过来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"없는데요.","meaning":"不在","explanation":"없다：不在；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는데요","audio":"/audio/33167b1daabf6bb5b81d.mp3"}},{"text":"십","meaning":"十","explanation":"십：汉字数词十；与后面的时间量词 분 合用，表示十分钟。","readings":[{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28847","senseId":"1","lemma":"십","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"십","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3"}},{"text":"분","meaning":"分钟","explanation":"분：分钟；십 분 写作两个词，表示十分钟。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70891","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}},{"text":"후에","meaning":"之后","explanation":"후：后、之后；-에 标记时间，십 분 후에 即“十分钟后”。","readings":[{"term":"후","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62885","senseId":"1","lemma":"후","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후에","audio":"/audio/6c3ac70f274ffaeff5ba.mp3"}},{"text":"다시","meaning":"再，再次","explanation":"다시：再，再次。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"1","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}},{"text":"전화","meaning":"电话","explanation":"전화：打电话、通话；与后面的 주다 合用，전화 주세요 表示“请给我打电话”。","readings":[{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20260","senseId":"2","lemma":"전화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"전화","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"请打电话","explanation":"전화 주다：给人打电话；-세요 是礼貌的请求语尾，这里请对方十分钟后再来电。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人、事物、现象等不占据某处或空间。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"c7470d030eddae16","term":"십","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/c7470d030eddae163a57.mp3","entryId":"28847","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["십"]},{"id":"ca4a187881dbf529","term":"분","zh":"分，分钟","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3","entryId":"70891","definition":"计时单位，一小时的六十分之一；십 분 是十分钟。","pronunciation":["분"]},{"id":"084a4bd8972f8d49","term":"후","zh":"后，以后，之后","audio":"/audio/084a4bd8972f8d494487.mp3","entryId":"62885","definition":"一定时间过去以后。","pronunciation":["후ː"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再，再次","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"反复相同的话或行动。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"6db518d738ede991","term":"전화","zh":"电话","audio":"/audio/6db518d738ede9912d10.mp3","entryId":"20260","definition":"通过电话与他人通话；전화 주세요 是“请打电话”。","pronunciation":["전ː화"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给、请（전화 주다：来电）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"在 전화 주다 中表示给对方打电话；这里是礼貌的来电请求。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8811cca54d0545c86094.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.69,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62885","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.0688,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["他现在不在。请十分钟后再打过来吧。","承奎在吗？","孩子刚才动了一下手指。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["承奎在吗？","孩子刚才动了一下手指。","他现在不在。请十分钟后再打过来吧。"],"answer":2}]}
